T* (that integrates multiple soil parameters including) Tj
T* (temperature, moisture/humidity, electrical conductivity) Tj
T* (\(EC\), nitrogen \(N\), phosphorus \(P\), potassium \(K\), and) Tj
T* (pH into a single probe. It measures soil dielectric) Tj
T* (constant to directly and stably reflect real moisture) Tj
T* (content across various soil types. The probe is made of) Tj
T* (stainless steel for corrosion resistance and stable) Tj
T* (performance. The input power supply, sensing probe,) Tj
T* (and signal output sections are fully isolated for safety) Tj
T* (and reliability. Communication is via RS485 \(Modbus) Tj
T* (RTU protocol\). Suitable for soil moisture monitoring,) Tj
T* (scientific experiments, water-saving irrigation,) Tj
T* (greenhouses, flowers, vegetables, grass pastures,) Tj
T* (rapid soil testing, plant cultivation, precision agriculture,) Tj
T* (and related applications.) Tj
